If you've watched direct1 David DeCoteau's previous movies (The Brotherhood series, The Frightening, Leeches), then you pretty much know what to expect:

1) buff young studs running around in their underwear f1 no apparent reason

2) slomo sequences that are so dull and repetitious, and used mainly to add minutes to the movie;

